+            # Optional[Dict[str, List[float]]] -- a dict of PER-ENTRY lists, e.g.
+            # {"llm": [...], "env": [...]} -- not a per-entry list itself. The loop's
+            # assumption ("every key except rollout_metrics is a per-entry list or None")
+            # is therefore false, and `value[i]` raises KeyError: 0 on the string-keyed
+            # dict. Only reachable when dynamic sampling actually FILTERS a batch, which
